     "text": "Trump said on social media on Friday that he struck the deal with Russian President Vladimir Putin in a phone call in which he was expected to discuss a suspected case of plague in Russia. Instead, Trump announced that Russia will immediately supply more than 300,000 tons of diesel, followed by an additional 500,000 tons in November and 1 million tons \"immediately thereafter.\" Russia will deliver an additional 3 million tons \"within a short period of time\" after that, he wrote.",
